<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_feb4cc35-2ec0-4f3e-a60c-ff9b1d529e2b"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1976-067" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Restraints of Trade Act
1976</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2b8f3d46-758c-40b7-a318-d8bcf8d08954"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_943e9536-84c6-4ab7-a31c-a907a77d486c"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_29093de6-3052-44ee-a0c6-ba21e721b641"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ca2d387d-8d9e-4e24-8ecf-798d76eaa305"
id="sec.2-def.association"><b><i>association</i></b></defterm> includes a
corporation.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_4411457e-4f0d-4172-a8b4-706e49639249"
id="sec.2-def.publicpolicy"><b><i>public policy</i></b></defterm> means public
policy in respect of restraint of trade.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c51e124c-6fd3-49ab-a3b4-fe70875c0cf8"
id="sec.2-def.rules"><b><i>rules</i></b></defterm> includes memorandum and
articles of association of a corporation and provisions of the constitution of
an unincorporated association.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a0b18770-c7ca-4c03-8bc8-c124be8acd75"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, except in subsection (1), <defterm
type="definition" guid="_5d2e9558-9694-467e-add3-54062ddd332f"
id="sec.2-def.restraintoftrade"><b><i>restraint of trade</i></b></defterm>
means a restraint of trade created by contract, created by the rules of an
association, or otherwise created.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_26c1f80b-ac2e-44bd-9058-3fe92fe59c4d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 2:</b> Am 2000 No 93,
Sch 1.22 [1].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_971b1748-9c8f-405a-b51f-0e87fef44234"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_4a2d9306-59f9-40c1-be27-3f4056312649"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Application of Act</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_70befc38-ded4-488b-8a6f-3c99dd233eab"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not apply to or in respect of a
restraint of trade created before the date of assent to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_27840f94-9667-4077-a846-20ebac239a22"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act applies notwithstanding any stipulation
to the contrary.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1e97628b-9331-4c31-8291-011951567b38"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not affect the operation of:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c6d59b8f-87c9-4c8f-9281-971959e3e237" id="sec.3-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">section 304 of the <legref refid="act-1996-017"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Industrial
Relations Act 1996</i></name></legref>,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_67df6101-9e4a-440f-ac77-e8b7fbadf6cb" id="sec.3-ssec.3-para1.b"
status="repealed">
<no>(b)</no>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>
</li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_28dce223-0863-4fcc-9682-e0c80ea6530b" id="sec.3-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">section 125 of the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Co-operatives National Law
(NSW)</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_89ac3534-15e7-4c77-873e-9a37a832bc27" id="sec.3-ssec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other enactment relating to the validity of a
restraint of trade.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>

<note type="legtext" guid="_da3ab08f-c2d8-4009-8e1a-276c52ef7ce9"
id="sec.3-note"><heading guid="_f9c62f57-43db-4f98-8f69-c706021b8b5c"
id="sec.3-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Competition Code of New South
Wales</i></name></legref> and the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Trade Practices Act
1974</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth make provision in relation to
restraints of trade.</txt></block></note>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1996 No 121,
Sch 4.44; 1998 No 11, Sch 6.20; 2000 No 93, Sch 1.22 [2] [3]; 2014 No 88, Sch
2.57.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b171b783-af3d-4073-a2e2-87e2ee6a255d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_e50995d6-a81f-4e84-923b-6ee6806fdedb"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Extent to which restraint of trade
valid</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_488d3399-992a-4c0d-941d-5aba1e5b7046"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A restraint of trade is valid to the extent to
which it is not against public policy, whether it is in severable terms or
not.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e08e7468-b974-4bb0-af47-76cf84807692"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) does not affect the invalidity of
a restraint of trade by reason of any matter other than public
policy.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_162d268f-c6f3-4437-a55e-1ffd131a4b2c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where, on application by a person subject to the
restraint, it appears to the Supreme Court that a restraint of trade is, as
regards its application to the applicant, against public policy to any extent
by reason of, or partly by reason of, a manifest failure by a person who
created or joined in creating the restraint to attempt to make the restraint a
reasonable restraint, the Court, having regard to the circumstances in which
the restraint was created, may, on such terms as the Court thinks fit, order
that the restraint be, as regards its application to the applicant, altogether
invalid or valid to such extent only (not exceeding the extent to which the
restraint is not against public policy) as the Court thinks fit and any such
order shall, notwithstanding sub-section (1), have effect on and from such
date (not being a date earlier than the date on which the order was made) as
is specified in the order.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e371dcd4-804e-4abe-afef-d2f1bf40a8db"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where, under the rules of an association, a
person who is a member of the association is subject to a restraint of trade,
the association shall, for the purposes of subsection (3), be deemed to have
created or joined in creating the restraint.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ed08f343-5559-4ec6-8c51-3c8fc469cca2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An order under subsection (3) does not affect any
right (including any right to damages) accrued before the date the order takes
effect.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


